      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{63691297469f06772579fe6f|full_name}: yeah, it was already working fine in VRC itself once the client started running on Unity v2019.4.40f1. i didn't ask to mark it as completed in those months though, because it was still an issue for us in the editor that we were supposed to work on.\n\nWith the relatively sudden release of new SDK and suggested editor version i forgot about this request, but it's now all ok to mark it as completed, thanks.",
